  "translation": "Daniyel (Daniel), ni a y'a dɔn ko sɛbɛn in siŋiralen don, a ye don a so kɔnɔ; a bɛ fɛnɛrɛ da-fɛnɛnenw a so sanfɛduguma kɔnɔ, minnu bɛ Yerushalayim (Jerusalɛmu) ɲɛfɛ; a bɛ don kelen kɔnɔ waati saba: a bɛ kun bila a ninfula kan, a bɛ jalaki kɛ, ka diya-fɔ Ala ɲɛfɛ, a yɛrɛ cogo min na a tun bɛ o kɛ kabini o tɛmɛnen na.",
